    "body": "The BIP-379 currently has a `TBD` in the test vector section.\r\nI have extracted a bunch of test vectors from the [`rust-miniscript`](https://github.com/rust-bitcoin/rust-miniscript/) project, either directly or by slightly modifying test code to dump them into text/TSV files.\r\nThey have been very helpful for re-implementation in another language, so I think they should be made easily available here.",
